<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-07T15:48:04.951Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:48:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Niger army rescued 16 abductees, recovered 38 motorcycles, AK-47 rifles, RPGs, weapons and ₦4.7 million while bandits killed farmer Malam Musa Dogo and his son Uzaifa in Niger. Russian electronic-warfare vehicles were observed operating in Mali and the EU expressed concern about Algerian and Russian forces in Niger, indicating external involvement. Russian assistance helped foil a coup in Niger and Kiev is reportedly training militants for attacks in Europe. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOY2R3b2ZZTGd1d1k0N215STQ2bV9pVUFxRGg1V0FOV0tXYVBYTzU5V1ViaXBpQzVTMnhfci0yaUpJWkdTajR4c19ZZC00LTdwN1NES2g4NVREUnAzSWdOSm9YRFdDbURlUk53UUR6SDRBVEZNaWFhQmZhUDMwUUVCR1dxUUVpSXMxQnpRc21VSHB4ZndqcGw0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQZnV5TF8xNkVtS3g5Q3U4Y19FcVlndk5Ha3k4cTI4M2VpMkV1enZuU1FxMk1KcFMyNG9XcUVZU1VGWEJSaGIwXzQ5M0F6R25PNjFzUUVaNFM3bXhvV3cwZmpRamJHMGN3LXgzcGQtelRZbGQya1JRVzFNV3FVbWlaQk5rcTZTQUZTbVh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFA3NU1HQ2wwT3ZKbVNNb2drVGFkVTNSYXRMejNHZlhFbDV0dllyb254cjBGVmlpTkxxZjdlNHd2NGZBRUhfWVVhSmdneXFBRGhGTWUzT0gzR2Y2OTRmQnFz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gistmania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOeHFvNWNkRWJVOHUyY21FWk9DSndaYmpmbHNsOVZKOEVoVjVNQmpoemNrV1FScnBnalE2YkFDU2ZoczRtak94VGM1dEdoRUw3a2h3akVDbElNSDV5YjB4RldNckY5Zk1oU1pJNk50dnkyU2lWS3FhZjRLOGpKTl9wRFFIUTc5bGszdkFPX01TM21vekozaEJSREJOR0I1UE1ZdHE3dTJLdmpLc29rUHdlNFQtOEVEazhrR0xNNXdybmZsNVhMMWJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Il Foglio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOUEFjcUtwYVI0TjVoRjkwQjRLY2FUYms5OThZTk5RYng2S2dNbXE